lers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Belm\" title=\"Belm\">Belm</a></span> </li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Dancing_Breeze\" title=\"The Dancing Breeze\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Glaive_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Glaive_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Glaive_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Glaive_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Glaive_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Glaive_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Glaive_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Glaive_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/Glaive_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Dancing_Breeze\" title=\"The Dancing Breeze\">The Dancing Breeze</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Other than the once-per-Short Rest recharge time, this action is equivalent to the <a href=\"/wiki/Whirlwind_Attack\" title=\"Whirlwind Attack\">Hunter version</a>. Refer there for more detailed notes.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715035948\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.086 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.092 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3583/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 47927/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14245/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLo